<Layout title="Drylining East Kilbride | Partition Walls &amp; Ceilings Contractors" description="Professional drylining contractors in East Kilbride. Expert partition walls, suspended ceilings, and plasterboard installation for East Kilbride, South Lanarkshire, and the wider G74-G78 postcode region. Free quotes." canonical="/areas/east-kilbride/" schema={schema}>
  <section style="position:relative;min-height:400px;display:flex;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a2e 0%,#16213e 100%);overflow:hidden;"> <img src="/images/hero-main.jpg" alt="Drylining services in East Kilbride and South Lanarkshire" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:0.25;"> <div class="container" style="position:relative;z-index:1;text-align:center;padding:60px 20px;"> <nav style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);margin-bottom:12px;"> <a href="/" style="text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);">Home</a> / <a href="/areas/" style="text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);">Areas</a> / <span style="color:#ffffff;">Drylining in East Kilbride</span> </nav> <h1 style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.15;">Drylining in East Kilbride</h1> <p style="font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.6;">CSCS-accredited drylining contractors delivering partition walls, suspended ceilings, and plasterboard across East Kilbride, South Lanarkshire, and the wider G74–G78 postcode region.</p> </div> </section> <section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:900px;"> <div style="padding:24px;margin-bottom:24px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary);background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);"> <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--text);"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Drylining East Kilbride provides drylining, partition walls, and suspended ceilings across East Kilbride (G74–G78), South Lanarkshire, and the wider area. Experienced with new town developments, commercial parks, and residential conversions in Scotland's largest new town.</p> </div> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Drylining Services in East Kilbride</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">East Kilbride is South Lanarkshire's largest town and Scotland's designated first new town, situated approximately 7 miles south-east of Glasgow city centre. The G74–G78 postcode areas cover the town's five villages (Village, Hamilton Place, Whitletts, Strathaven Place, and Long Calderwood) along with its extensive commercial parks and retail developments. East Kilbride has a population of around 79,000 and is one of the largest towns in Scotland. Its unique character — combining post-war new town planning with modern commercial expansion — creates a distinctive mix of drylining projects, from residential conversions in period-inspired new town housing to large-scale commercial fit-outs at the East Kilbride Business Park, Strathaven Road retail corridor, and the town centre's ongoing regeneration. As one of the most populous towns in the Strathclyde region, East Kilbride provides consistent demand for quality drylining services across South Lanarkshire.</p> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The area offers a distinctive mix of projects for our drylining team — from the careful internal refurbishment of new town residential properties to large-scale commercial fit-outs across East Kilbride's business parks and retail developments. We cover the entire G74–G78 postcode region, serving everything from single-room domestic projects to multi-storey commercial buildings. All work is carried out to Scottish Building Standards compliant with all relevant sections.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">What We Do in East Kilbride</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Our East Kilbride crew handles everything from new town residential conversions to large-scale commercial fit-outs — covering partition walls, suspended ceilings, and fire-rated wall systems across the G74–G78 postcode and South Lanarkshire.</p> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li><strong>New town property drylining</strong> — Internal wall insulation, room conversions, and partition walls in East Kilbride's unique new town housing developments across all five villages</li> <li><strong>Commercial fit-outs</strong> — Office refurbs, retail units, and hospitality venues at East Kilbride Business Park, Strathaven Road, and the town centre</li> <li><strong>New build drylining</strong> — Pre-completion drylining for residential developments and housing extensions across South Lanarkshire</li> <li><strong>Fire-rated walls</strong> — Multi-storey residential and commercial buildings requiring Scottish Building Standards Section 2 (Fire) compliance</li> <li><strong>Suspended ceilings</strong> — Commercial premises, offices, education facilities, and retail developments across East Kilbride</li> <li><strong>Acoustic partitions</strong> — Residential properties, student accommodation, and mixed-use developments in East Kilbride and surrounding South Lanarkshire areas</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Areas of East Kilbride We Cover</h2> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li>East Kilbride town centre (G74) — The Core retail area, Kilbride Square</li> <li>Village (G74) — East Kilbride's original village centre and surrounding housing</li> <li>Hamilton Place (G74)</li> <li>Whitletts (G75)</li> <li>Strathaven Place (G74)</li> <li>Long Calderwood (G75)</li> <li>East Kilbride Business Park (G74)</li> <li>Giffnock — 10 minutes via M77</li> <li>Glasgow city centre — 25 minutes via M77</li> <li>South Lanarkshire area generally</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">East Kilbride Building Regulations &amp; Planning</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">East Kilbride falls under <strong>South Lanarkshire Council</strong> for building standards and planning. The town centre and surrounding areas contain numerous properties within conservation designations, particularly in the original Village area. Internal structural alterations may require additional consent from the council. We work closely with clients, architects, and the council's building standards department to ensure every project — from a simple room partition in a new town property to a large-scale commercial fit-out at the Business Park — is fully compliant with Scottish Building Standards and any additional conservation requirements.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Why Choose Us for East Kilbride Projects</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">As an Edinburgh-based drylining team, we have extensive experience working across South Lanarkshire, including East Kilbride, Glasgow, and the surrounding areas. We understand the unique character of East Kilbride — from its distinctive new town planning to the modern commercial developments driving growth in the town centre. Our crew is familiar with Scottish Building Standards and the particular requirements of working in Scotland's largest new town. Whether you need drylining for a new town residential property, a commercial fit-out, or a retail development, our team delivers quality work on time and within budget.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Related Services</h2> <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <a href="/services/partition-walls/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px